# Local secrets for `wrangler dev` / `npm run dev`.
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (which is gitignored) and fill in the real values.
# NEVER commit `.dev.vars` or paste real keys into wrangler.jsonc.
#
# Production equivalents are set with: npx wrangler secret put <NAME>

# Mem.ai API key — shared memory across Claude instances. Get it from mem.ai settings.
MEM_API_KEY=sk-mem-xxxxxxxx-your-key-here

# Optional: override the coordination auth token for local dev.
# Defaults to the value in wrangler.jsonc vars.API_KEY if unset.
# API_KEY=symphony-ken-2026

# Polar webhook signing secret, copied from the webhook's settings in Polar.
# Without it the Worker refuses every delivery to POST /polar/webhook with 503 —
# it never falls back to accepting unverified events.
#
# Local:      copy this file to .dev.vars and fill it in
# Deployed:   wrangler secret put POLAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET
POLAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""

# Discord application public key, from the application's General Information
# page (64 hex characters). Without it the Worker refuses every request to
# POST /discord/interactions with 503.
#
# Deployed:   wrangler secret put DISCORD_PUBLIC_KEY
DISCORD_PUBLIC_KEY=""

# Discord user ids allowed to run `/omega bind`, comma-separated. This exists
# only to break the bootstrap cycle: before any binding exists nobody can hold
# `registry.admin`, so nobody could create the first one. Every other command
# authorizes against Polar entitlements, not against this list.
#
# Deployed:   wrangler secret put DISCORD_OPERATOR_IDS
DISCORD_OPERATOR_IDS=""
